"<br>\n"
"                            Subscribe here to make sure you will not miss an "
"episode!"
msgstr ""
"<br>\n"
"                            ຕິດຕາມບ່ອນນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຈະບໍ່ພາດຕອນໃດເລີຍ!"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_campaign_brief
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        Describe your campaign in just a few words.\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        ອະທິບາຍແຄມເປນຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຄຳສັບສັ້ນໆ.\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_campaign_brief
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        How will your measure progress?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        ທ່ານຈະວັດແທກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າແນວໃດ?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_campaign_brief
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        What are you trying to accomplish with this "
"campaign?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        ທ່ານພະຍາຍາມບັນລຸສິ່ງໃດກັບແຄມເປນນີ້?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_campaign_brief
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        What are you trying to convince them of?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        ທ່ານພະຍາຍາມໂນ້ມນ້າວພວກເຂົາເລື່ອງຫຍັງ?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_campaign_brief
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        Who are you trying to reach?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">\n"
"                        ທ່ານກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງໃຜ?\n"
"                    </font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Ask a Senior Engineer to fill "
"this part before launching the task.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ໃຫ້ວິສະວະກອນອາວຸໂສຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນນີ້ກ່ອນເລີ່ມວຽກ.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Ask the developer to go through "
"this checklist before asking for a review.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາກວດເບິ່ງລາຍການກວດສອບນີ້ກ່ອນຮ້ອງຂໍການກວດທານ.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Explain in a few words the "
"problem that this change is going to solve.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ອະທິບາຍບັນຫາທີ່ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ຈະແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຄຳສັບສັ້ນໆ.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Explain in a single sentence "
"what has been changed.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ອະທິບາຍດ້ວຍປະໂຫຍກດຽວວ່າໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຫຍັງແດ່.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_post_mortem
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Explain the consequences of "
"this issue.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ອະທິບາຍຜົນກະທົບຂອງບັນຫານີ້.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_post_mortem
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Explain what went wrong in just "
"a few words.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຄຳສັບສັ້ນໆ.</"
"font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_post_mortem
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">How did it get to happen?</"
"font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ມັນເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ແນວໃດ?</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_post_mortem
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">How was it solved?</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ມັນຖືກແກ້ໄຂແນວໃດ?</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">Lay here any remaining question "
"or doubt.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ວາງຄຳຖາມ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ສົງໄສທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອໄວ້ບ່ອນນີ້.</"
"font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">List here all the changes to "
"implement.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ລະບຸການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການໄວ້ບ່ອນນີ້.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_software_specification
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">List here all the material and "
"documentation related to the task.</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">ລະບຸເອກະສານ ແລະ "
"ສື່ອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວຽກໄວ້ບ່ອນນີ້.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_personal_organizer
msgid ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font class=\"text-600\">List here all the text you "
"could not do this week. These shall be postponed in the next weekly schedule."
"</font>\n"
"                </em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>\n"
"                    <font "
"class=\"text-600\">ລະບຸເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນອາທິດນີ້. "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເລື່ອນໄປໃສ່ຕາຕະລາງປະຈຳອາທິດຕໍ່ໄປ.</font>\n"
"                </em>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_customer_personas
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                            <em>How to best reach this customer type.</em>\n"
"                        </font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                            <em>ວິທີເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຄ້າປະເພດນີ້ໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.</em>\n"
"                        </font>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_customer_persona_3
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>How to best reach this customer type.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                Abigail works a lot and never watches TV. Better reach her "
"on her phone or on her to work."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>ວິທີເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຄ້າປະເພດນີ້ໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                Abigail ເຮັດວຽກໜັກ ແລະ ບໍ່ເຄີຍເບິ່ງໂທລະພາບ. "
"ຄວນເຂົ້າເຖິງລາວຜ່ານທາງໂທລະສັບ ຫຼື ໃນລະຫວ່າງທາງໄປເຮັດວຽກ."

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_customer_persona_4
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>How to best reach this customer type.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                As a classic Gen Z member, Vittorio never watches TV and "
"never listens to the radio. For him to see our message, we need to get to "
"his Instagram feed."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>ວິທີເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຄ້າປະເພດນີ້ໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                ໃນຖານະທີ່ເປັນຄົນຮຸ່ນ Gen Z ແທ້ໆ, Vittorio ບໍ່ເຄີຍເບິ່ງໂທລະພາບ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ເຄີຍຟັງວິທະຍຸເລີຍ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາວເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໄປຢູ່ໃນຟີດ Instagram "
"ຂອງລາວ."

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_customer_persona_1
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>How to best reach this customer type.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                As an avid music listener, the best way to reach Sonya is "
"through the radio since hers is always on."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>ວິທີເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຄ້າປະເພດນີ້ໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                ໃນຖານະຜູ້ທີ່ມັກຟັງເພງເປັນປະຈຳ, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Sonya "
"ແມ່ນຜ່ານທາງວິທະຍຸ ເພາະລາວເປີດໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:knowledge.knowledge_article_template_marketing_customer_persona_2
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>How to best reach this customer type.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"                Julius follows politics very tightly, and can best be "
"reached with TV ads."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-400\">\n"
"                    <em>ວິທີເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຄ້າປະເພດນີ້ໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.<br></em>\n"
"                </font>\n"
